### Locations & Bins API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 1. Login to get token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "password123"
}

### ── Locations (Nested under Warehouse) ──

### 2. Create a location in Warehouse 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/1/locations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "zone": "A",
    "row": "01",
    "aisle": "L",
    "bay": "01",
    "created_by": 1
}

### 3. List active locations in Warehouse 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Update a location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/1/locations/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "zone": "A",
    "row": "01",
    "aisle": "L",
    "bay": "02",
    "updated_by": 1
}


### ── Bins (Nested under Location) ──

### 5. Create a bin in Location 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/locations/1/bins
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "bin_code": "A-01-L-01-BIN01",
    "capacity": 100,
    "created_by": 1
}

### 6. List active bins in Location 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations/1/bins
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. List all bins under Warehouse 1 (with location info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations/bins/warehouse/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Update a bin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/locations/1/bins/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "bin_code": "A-01-L-01-BIN01-X",
    "capacity": 200,
    "updated_by": 1
}


### ── Inventory Operations ──

### 9. Manual item assignment to Bin 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/bins/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "item_id": 1,
    "quantity": 45,
    "assigned_by": 1
}

### 10. Bin-to-bin transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/bins/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "item_id": 1,
    "from_bin_id": 1,
    "to_bin_id": 2,
    "quantity": 10,
    "transferred_by": 1,
    "reason": "Stock rebalancing"
}
